# ── Update syncs; it does not audit ──────────────────────────────────────────
check(
    "update: the procedure inspects nothing in the project's org",
    "never inspects the project's org" in upd
    and "Do not run `verify` for them" in upd,
    "update ran verify as its last step, so the cost of staying current scaled "
